window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He decided I was his before he even knew my name.</b><br> <br> When Zachariah Blackwell caught me sneaking into his office to spy on the Obsidian Society, the brutal bastard bent me over his desk and belted my ass before claiming it even more roughly.<br> <br> Then my billionaire boss—the same man I've seen break another man's arm for daring to put his hands on me—told me he was in my house last night.<br> <br> Watching me writhe and moan in my sleep. Hearing me whisper his name as I slid my fingers beneath my panties. Knowing he was ripping my clothes off and ravaging me in my dreams.<br> <br> But as I came over and over again for my stalker boss, I kept my own secret.<br> <br> I already knew it was him that night.</p> <p><b>Publisher's Note:</b> <i>Seducer</i> is the second book in the <i>Legacy of Kings</i> series but can be listened to as a standalone. It includes spankings and rough, intense sexual scenes. If such material offends you, please don't buy this book.</p>"; 
